Allah, dan aku tidak \">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Yusuf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/12.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 108\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/12-108.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/12.html\">Surah Yusuf</a> › Ayat 108</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Yusuf 12:108</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قُلْ هَٰذِهِ سَبِيلِي أَدْعُو إِلَى اللَّهِ عَلَىٰ بَصِيرَةٍ أَنَا وَمَنِ اتَّبَعَنِي وَسُبْحَانَ اللَّهِ وَمَا أَنَا مِنَ الْمُشْرِكِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Katakanlah (Muhammad), &quot;Inilah jalanku, aku dan orang-orang yang mengikutiku mengajak (kamu) kepada Allah berlandaskan ilmu, Mahasuci Allah, dan aku tidak termasuk orang-orang musyrik.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">الدعوة إلى الله هي الدعوة إلى الإيمان به وبما جاءت به رسله بتصديقهم فيما أخبروا به وطاعتهم فيما أمروا<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 15/157</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أي أنا وأتباعي على بصيرة.<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 2/451</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر تعالى أن من اتبع الرسول يدعو إلى الله، ومن دعا إلى الله على بصيرة وجب اتباعه<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 4/100</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s12a108\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/12-106.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (12:106)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/12-110.html\">Ayat berikutnya (12:110)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/12-110.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Yusuf 12:110 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sehingga apabila para rasul tidak mempunyai harapan lagi (tentang keimanan kaumnya) dan telah meyakini bahwa mereka telah didustakan, datanglah kepada mere\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Yusuf 12:110 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sehingga apabila para rasul tidak mempunyai harapan lagi (tentang keimanan kaumnya) dan telah meyakini bahwa mereka telah didustakan, datanglah kepada mere\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Yusuf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/12.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 110\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/12-110.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/12.html\">Surah Yusuf</a> › Ayat 110</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Yusuf 12:110</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿حَتَّىٰ إِذَا اسْتَيْأَسَ الرُّسُلُ وَظَنُّوا أَنَّهُمْ قَدْ كُذِبُوا جَاءَهُمْ نَصْرُنَا فَنُجِّيَ مَن نَّشَاءُ وَلَا يُرَدُّ بَأْسُنَا عَنِ الْقَوْمِ الْمُجْرِمِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sehingga apabila para rasul tidak mempunyai harapan lagi (tentang keimanan kaumnya) dan telah meyakini bahwa mereka telah didustakan, datanglah kepada mereka (para rasul) itu pertolongan Kami, lalu diselamatkan orang yang Kami kehendaki. Dan siksa Kami tidak dapat ditolak dari orang yang berdosa.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولكن القراءة الأخرى ثابتة لا يمكن إنكارها وقد تأولها ابن عباس وظاهر الكلام معه<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 15/176</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والظن لا يراد به في الكتاب والسنة الاعتقاد الراجح كما هو في اصطلاح طائفة من أهل الكلام<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 15/176</cite></blockquote><h3>Yang beliau nukil dari selainnya</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">عائشة (قراءة التثقيل: كُذِّبوا)</span> <span class=\"st\">رجّح غيره</span> «معاذ الله والله ما وعد الله رسوله من شيء قط إلا علم أنه كائن قبل أن يكون؛ ولكن لم يزل البلاء بالرسل حتى ظنوا وخافوا أن يكون من معهم يكذبهم»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 15/176</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s12a110\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/12-108.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (12:108)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/12-111.html\">Ayat berikutnya (12:111)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/12-111.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Yusuf 12:111 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sungguh, pada kisah-kisah mereka itu terdapat pengajaran bagi orang yang mempunyai akal. (Al-Qur`an) itu bukanlah cerita yang dibuat-buat, tetapi membenark\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Yusuf 12:111 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sungguh, pada kisah-kisah mereka itu terdapat pengajaran bagi orang yang mempunyai akal. (Al-Qur`an) itu bukanlah cerita yang dibuat-buat, tetapi membenark\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Yusuf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/12.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 111\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/12-111.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/12.html\">Surah Yusuf</a> › Ayat 111</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Yusuf 12:111</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿لَقَدْ كَانَ فِي قَصَصِهِمْ عِبْرَةٌ لِّأُولِي الْأَلْبَابِ مَا كَانَ حَدِيثًا يُفْتَرَىٰ وَلَٰكِن تَصْدِيقَ الَّذِي بَيْنَ يَدَيْهِ وَتَفْصِيلَ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ وَهُدًى وَرَحْمَةً لِّقَوْمٍ يُؤْمِنُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sungguh, pada kisah-kisah mereka itu terdapat pengajaran bagi orang yang mempunyai akal. (Al-Qur`an) itu bukanlah cerita yang dibuat-buat, tetapi membenarkan (kitab-kitab) yang sebelumnya, menjelaskan segala sesuatu, dan (sebagai) petunjuk dan rahmat bagi orang-orang yang beriman.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والاعتبار أن يقرن الشيء بمثله فيعلم أن حكمه مثل حكمه<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 13/20</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أفاد أن من عمل مثل أعمالهم جوزي مثل جزائهم؛ ليحذر أن يعمل مثل أعمال الكفار؛ وليرغب في أن يعمل مثل أعمال المؤمنين أتباع الأنبياء<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 13/20</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s12a111\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/12-110.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (12:110)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}